              "descriptionEn": "specific access/selection critique 2; 56 versus 40% 1; small subgroup and uncertainty 1; size alone insufficient 1"
            },
            {
              "id": "new_by_critical_conditional_data_5",
              "points": 5,
              "description": "suggestive Frage und neutrale Alternative 2; falsche Bezugsgruppe 1; korrekte Überschrift 1; Gruppengrößen/Definition 1",
              "descriptionEn": "leading wording and neutral alternative 2; false reference group 1; corrected title 1; group sizes/definition 1"
            },
            {
